<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's O/N rates egde up to close at 19.75 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary's O/N rates egde up to close at 19.75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's overnight interest rates edged up to 19.75 percent on Thursday in routine trading, dealers said.</p>
<p>Overnight rates traded between 19.375 and 19.875 percent with most deals struck at 19.625 and 19.75 percent compared with Wednesday's close of 19.50 percent.</p>
<p>Traders said overnight rates were likely to move between 19.50 and 20.00 percent over the next days.</p>
<p>-- Denes Albert, Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
